  "question": {
    "text": "Let the area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mrow><mi>min</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mi>A</mi></math> is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
